          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ためしの一粒が瓶の中を落下しています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ためしの一粒は任意です。記録を作らず、「次へ」でそのまま進めます。" : {
      "comment" : "Trial page with VoiceOver: the trial gem is optional; 次へ is the Next button",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The trial gem is optional. It creates no record, and you can simply tap “Next” to continue."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ためしの一粒は任意です。記録を作らず、「次へ」でそのまま進めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ためし積み" : {
      "comment" : "Theme name of the onboarding trial gem (never saved)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trial"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ためし積み"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "できない日があっても、警告や罰はない" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding promise detail: no warnings or penalties on days you can't focus",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No warnings or penalties, even on days you can’t focus"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "できない日があっても、警告や罰はない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "どれを選んでも、質量・粒の融合・結晶・成果・使える機能は同じです。ランダムな結果を使わない「抽選しない」が安全な基準です。" : {
      "comment" : "Rare gem choice: every option keeps mass, fusion, crystals, achievements and features the same; 抽選しない is the no-draw option",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whatever you choose, mass, gem fusion, crystals, achievements and every feature stay the same. “No Draws”, which uses no random results, is the safe default."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どれを選んでも、質量・粒の融合・結晶・成果・使える機能は同じです。ランダムな結果を使わない「抽選しない」が安全な基準です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "はじめての一粒" : {
      "comment" : "Eyebrow of the onboarding trial drop page",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your First Gem"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "はじめての一粒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まず1つ選んでください。仕事の種類は、瓶をひらいた後も自由に追加・編集できます。" : {
      "comment" : "Legacy usage purpose: setup note for work themes",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose one to start. You can add and edit kinds of work freely after the jar opens."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まず1つ選んでください。仕事の種類は、瓶をひらいた後も自由に追加・編集できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "まず1つ選んでください。資格名や科目は、瓶をひらいた後も自由に追加・編集できます。" : {
      "comment" : "Legacy usage purpose: setup note for study themes",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose one to start. You can add and edit subjects and certifications freely after the jar opens."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まず1つ選んでください。資格名や科目は、瓶をひらいた後も自由に追加・編集できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう一度" : {
      "comment" : "Trial page button: try the drop again",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Try Again"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "もう一度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アーカイブ済みのテーマ" : {
      "comment" : "Name shown for a record whose theme was deleted and left no name",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Archived theme"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アーカイブ済みのテーマ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "シェアカードにテーマ名は載せません。成果メモも載せません。終了通知にもテーマ名は表示しません。案件名・顧客名・個人名などの守秘情報は入れず、「企画」「顧客対応」のような大分類がおすすめです。" : {
      "comment" : "Legacy usage purpose: privacy note for work themes (theme names never appear on share cards or notifications)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Share cards never show theme names or achievement notes, and timer-end notifications never show theme names. Leave out confidential details such as project, client or personal names; broad categories like “Planning” or “Customer Support” work best."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シェアカードにテーマ名は載せません。成果メモも載せません。終了通知にもテーマ名は表示しません。案件名・顧客名・個人名などの守秘情報は入れず、「企画」「顧客対応」のような大分類がおすすめです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "テーマ" : {
      "comment" : "Restore waiting screen: count label for themes",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Themes"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "テーマ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "テーマと時間を選んで、集中をはじめる。\n完走すると、その時間が一粒になって瓶に残ります。" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding page 1: how a focus becomes a gem in the jar",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a theme and a length, then start a focus.\nFinish it, and that time stays in your jar as a gem."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "テーマと時間を選んで、集中をはじめる。\n完走すると、その時間が一粒になって瓶に残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "テーマは合計最大%lld件です。不要なテーマは設定から削除できます。" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding: theme limit reached; %lld is the maximum number of themes (12)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "You can have up to %lld theme in all. You can delete themes you don’t need in Settings."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "You can have up to %lld themes in all. You can delete themes you don’t need in Settings."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "テーマは合計最大%lld件です。不要なテーマは設定から削除できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "テーマを1つ選ぶと、瓶をひらけます" : {
